-- 0002_seed.sql
-- Canonical content seed for the foodblog, snapshotted from the curated database.
-- Replaces the historical import + the 15 follow-up data-fix migrations that were
-- squashed before release.
--
-- Translations and roles/permissions are intentionally absent: they are (re)created
-- idempotently at startup by TranslationSeeder and Seeder. Only TAG slugs are seeded (as the
-- old migration 0017 did) so tag URLs resolve immediately; content slugs (article/recipe/
-- page/ingredient) are produced at startup by SlugBackfill, which then keeps everything in sync.
--
-- Foreign keys are ON during the DbUp migration, so the tables below are inserted in
-- dependency order (images before users, taggables before articles/recipes/taggings,
-- units before recipe_ingredients, tags before taggings, recipes before their children).

-- units (24 rows)

-- images (37 rows)

-- users (3 rows)

-- user_roles (3 rows)

-- taggables (40 rows)

-- tags (39 rows)

-- articles (4 rows)
